{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "1789236208000-b27d2d", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "三季度过完了大半，帮我列一下Q3复盘要看的几个核心数字。", "id": "541e7734e5f64633aa2a7bb7333858a2", "created_at": "2026-09-12T18:03:28", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "4a602a2ca0c94e908dcc5015b4113af5", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-12T18:03:28", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "dd2ee4c321ef4f8f84f000fe12cd2e0e", "created_at": "2026-09-12T18:03:36", "finished_at": "2026-09-12T18:04:18"}, {"type": "text", "text": "**Q3 复盘核心数字**\n1. 订单额 vs 目标（完成率%及缺口）\n2. 按期交付率（目标≥92%）\n3. 回款率与超期账款余额\n4. 售后一次闭环率\n5. 新客户成交数\n每项给：目标 / 实际 / 差距原因 / Q4 动作。", "id": "351edb8b30454daba1c892e9ec6cad33", "created_at": "2026-09-12T18:03:36", "finished_at": "2026-09-12T18:04:18"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "46abea363b0848d885316b8daac95665", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-12T18:03:36", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-12T18:04:18", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "缺口原因部分怎么写不流于形式？", "id": "b3d50318cd5648599caca98bb3ab78b7", "created_at": "2026-09-12T18:07:28", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "da55fade4b1e4edd9cd45701b8764b6e", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-12T18:07:28", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "ec4e4723924d482ea377d4ab757f1eb8", "created_at": "2026-09-12T18:07:36", "finished_at": "2026-09-12T18:08:18"}, {"type": "text", "text": "写法用「归因到动作」：每条差距必须落到一件具体的事——是某个环节没做到（如采购提前期不够）、还是外部变化（客户砍单），并对应一个 Q4 改善动作+责任人+时间点。禁止只写“市场波动”这种没法行动的归因。", "id": "488fdf0b15144bd290a7f074d3295113", "created_at": "2026-09-12T18:07:36", "finished_at": "2026-09-12T18:08:18"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "ff4cc34f23214036b5228d0ddd5f84b7", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-12T18:07:36", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-12T18:08:18", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_context": {}, "tasks_context": {}, "middle_context": {}}}}